    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this 2D survival RPG set in a post-apocalyptic landscape, players must gather materials, construct a safe haven, and fend off the monstrous threats that roam the earth. With a robust crafting system, you can create a variety of tiles, allowing you to reshape the world around you. As you embark on thrilling quests and aid fellow survivors, you\u2019ll gain recognition and wealth, paving your way to building the stronghold of your dreams. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into endless exploration and unleash your creativity in a game where survival is just the beginning!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Robust Crafting System</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite World Exploration</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Customization</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Role Playing Elements</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Survival Mode</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic, Retro, Nostalgic</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEW Multiplayer Mode!</strong></p></li></ul>",
